 "_flex_align_self": "center"}, "elements": [{"id": "ab72cda", "settings": {"title": "Pr\u00e9stamos para Aceptaci\u00f3n de Herencias en Islas Baleares", "header_size": "h1", "typography_typography": "custom", "typography_font_family": "Roboto", "typography_font_size": {"unit": "px", "size": 28, "sizes": []}, "typography_font_weight": "300", "title_color": "#598199", "_margin": {"unit": "%", "top": "-2", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "__dynamic__": {"title": "[elementor-tag id=\"36988ea\" name=\"page-title\" settings=\"%7B%7D\"]"}, "_element_width": "initial", "_element_custom_width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "_margin_tablet": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "_margin_mobile": {"unit": "%", "top": "", "right": "", "bottom": "", "left": "", "isLinked": true}, "align": "center", "typography_font_size_mobile": {"unit": "px", "size": 18, "sizes": []}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "0b3a07f"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "3616d4c"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "347e00c", "settings": {"editor": "<p>En ProActivo Finance ayudamos a herederos, familias y propietarios en las Islas Baleares que necesitan <strong>liquidez inmediata</strong> para aceptar una herencia sin vender activos por debajo de su valor.</p><p>Recibir una herencia en Mallorca, Ibiza, Menorca o Formentera puede convertirse en una oportunidad patrimonial, pero tambi\u00e9n en un reto financiero cuando existen impuestos, <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/reunificacion-de-deudas-en-islas-baleares/\"><strong>deudas pendientes</strong></a>, cargas registrales o gastos notariales que deben resolverse antes de poder disponer de los bienes.</p><p>Nuestro servicio de <strong>pr\u00e9stamos para aceptaci\u00f3n de herencias en Islas Baleares</strong> permite obtener <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/financiacion-con-capital-privado-en-islas-baleares/\"><strong>financiaci\u00f3n privada</strong></a> con <strong>garant\u00eda inmobiliaria</strong> para afrontar estos pagos con rapidez, seguridad jur\u00eddica y una estructura adaptada a cada caso.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "6996940"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "3f518ff"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "76abd96", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "50d8fe6", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfQu\u00e9 es un pr\u00e9stamo para aceptaci\u00f3n de herencias?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "eb6abc0"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "928579b"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "8b0ba2b", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Un pr\u00e9stamo para aceptaci\u00f3n de herencias es una soluci\u00f3n de financiaci\u00f3n pensada para personas que han recibido bienes en herencia, pero necesitan capital para completar el proceso de adjudicaci\u00f3n, liquidar impuestos o desbloquear una situaci\u00f3n patrimonial compleja.</p><p>En lugar de esperar una respuesta bancaria lenta o vender una propiedad con urgencia, puedes utilizar un inmueble como garant\u00eda para obtener liquidez en pocos d\u00edas. Esta alternativa resulta especialmente \u00fatil cuando la herencia incluye viviendas, locales, terrenos o activos inmobiliarios situados en zonas de alto valor de las Islas Baleares.</p><p>En ProActivo Finance analizamos la operaci\u00f3n de forma \u00e1gil y realista. Valoramos el activo, revisamos la situaci\u00f3n registral y dise\u00f1amos una propuesta de <a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/\"><strong>capital privado</strong></a> orientada a resolver el problema sin a\u00f1adir m\u00e1s presi\u00f3n al proceso familiar.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "f45d386"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "ce95e8a"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "f1b217b", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}}, "elements": [{"id": "7e892f5", "settings": {"title": "Situaciones habituales en herencias en Mallorca, Ibiza o Menorca", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "461f8ca"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "003b9f8"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "5d1fa64", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Cada herencia tiene sus particularidades. Algunas son sencillas, pero otras requieren actuar r\u00e1pido para evitar bloqueos, recargos o conflictos entre herederos. En Baleares, adem\u00e1s, el valor de los inmuebles hace que una mala decisi\u00f3n financiera pueda tener un impacto patrimonial importante.</p><p>Trabajamos habitualmente con casos como:</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "1bd7d3d"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "65a301b"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "de79dcb", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Herederos que necesitan pagar el <strong>Impuesto de Sucesiones</strong> antes de adjudicarse los bienes.</li><li>Familias con propiedades heredadas que tienen cargas, hipotecas o deudas pendientes.</li><li>Herencias con varios beneficiarios donde uno de ellos necesita liquidez para compensar al resto.</li><li>Propietarios que quieren conservar un inmueble familiar y evitar una venta precipitada.</li><li><a href=\"https://proactivofinance.com/prestamos-para-cancelar-embargos-y-subastas-en-islas-baleares\"><strong>Situaciones con embargos, subastas</strong></a> o deudas asociadas a los bienes heredados.</li></ul>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "a2994f8"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "4707641"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "6d49e67", "settings": {"editor": "<p>En todos estos escenarios, el objetivo es el mismo: desbloquear la herencia con una soluci\u00f3n r\u00e1pida, clara y respaldada por garant\u00eda real.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "f929fe6"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "d56bc7c"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "16e9c8b", "settings": {"content_width": "full", "margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": true}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "40", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}}, "elements": [{"id": "80bac21", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfPor qu\u00e9 usar capital privado para aceptar una herencia?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "258f5c3"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "2f3202e"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "667490f", "settings": {"editor": "<p>La banca tradicional no siempre responde bien ante procesos hereditarios. Suele exigir documentaci\u00f3n extensa, ingresos recurrentes, an\u00e1lisis de riesgo y plazos que no encajan con la urgencia de pagar impuestos, cancelar deudas o firmar ante notario.</p><p>La financiaci\u00f3n privada, en cambio, permite valorar la operaci\u00f3n desde otro enfoque. Si existe un inmueble con valor suficiente y la operaci\u00f3n tiene sentido, podemos estructurar un pr\u00e9stamo adaptado al momento real del cliente.</p><p>Entre las principales ventajas destacan:</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "c4c1dc9"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "a32e9e1"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "096faa1", "settings": {"flex_direction": "column", "container_type": "grid", "grid_gaps": {"column": "10", "row": "10", "isLinked": true, "unit": "px"}, "padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "presetTitle": "Grid", "presetIcon": "eicon-container-grid", "animation": "fadeInUp", "content_width": "full", "width": {"unit": "%", "size": 100, "sizes": []}, "min_height": {"unit": "px", "size": 0, "sizes": []},