true}, "text_color": "#598199", "_flex_align_self": "flex-start", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "6065daf"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "ad2af92"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "d070d6e", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Esta v\u00eda no sustituye al asesoramiento legal o fiscal, pero s\u00ed puede aportar la liquidez necesaria para que ese asesoramiento pueda ejecutarse sin que la herencia quede paralizada.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "216ed9f"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "724df67"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}, {"id": "0f622f8", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfQu\u00e9 inmuebles pueden servir como garant\u00eda en Baleares?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "c47a176"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "49efde3"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "2c761dc", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Las Islas Baleares cuentan con un mercado inmobiliario muy activo, especialmente en zonas como Palma, Calvi\u00e0, Andratx, Ibiza, Santa Eulalia, Mah\u00f3n o Ciutadella. Esa fortaleza patrimonial permite plantear operaciones de financiaci\u00f3n privada cuando el activo heredado o aportado tiene valor suficiente.</p><p>Podemos estudiar garant\u00edas como:</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "7ce4568"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "f6ffbba"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "d704427", "settings": {"editor": "<ul><li>Viviendas urbanas, apartamentos o casas familiares.</li><li>Locales comerciales, oficinas o inmuebles vinculados a actividad empresarial.</li><li>Terrenos urbanos o parcelas con potencial de desarrollo.</li><li>Fincas r\u00fasticas con valor acreditable.</li><li>Inmuebles con cargas, siempre que la operaci\u00f3n permita regularizarlas.</li></ul>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "557123f"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "ffc656d"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "9a2dea6", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Lo importante no es solo el tipo de inmueble, sino la relaci\u00f3n entre el valor del activo, el importe solicitado y la viabilidad del plan de devoluci\u00f3n.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "696963b"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "93f327b"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "c3f3c21", "settings": {"title": "\u00bfC\u00f3mo funciona el proceso con ProActivo Finance?", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "e698834"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "9c5bac2"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "9848ee2", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Nuestro proceso est\u00e1 dise\u00f1ado para actuar con rapidez, pero sin improvisar. Sabemos que una herencia puede tener implicaciones emocionales, familiares y jur\u00eddicas, por eso trabajamos con discreci\u00f3n y claridad desde el primer contacto.</p><p>Primero revisamos la situaci\u00f3n: tipo de herencia, bienes incluidos, importe necesario y urgencia del caso. Despu\u00e9s analizamos la garant\u00eda inmobiliaria disponible y planteamos una propuesta de financiaci\u00f3n privada ajustada al objetivo real.</p><p>Si la operaci\u00f3n es viable, avanzamos hacia la firma ante notario y la disposici\u00f3n de fondos. Con esa liquidez, el cliente puede pagar impuestos, cancelar cargas, cerrar tr\u00e1mites o conservar el activo heredado sin venderlo deprisa.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "20921e7"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "3570a1a"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "ba3b387", "settings": {"title": "Una soluci\u00f3n para conservar patrimonio y ganar tiempo", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "ef021d5"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "e993d22"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "ea88aaa", "settings": {"editor": "<p>Muchas decisiones equivocadas en una herencia se toman por falta de liquidez. Vender r\u00e1pido, aceptar una oferta baja o dejar que una deuda avance puede salir mucho m\u00e1s caro que estructurar una financiaci\u00f3n temporal bien planteada.</p><p>En ProActivo Finance ofrecemos una alternativa para quienes necesitan margen de maniobra. Nuestro objetivo es que puedas aceptar la herencia, proteger el patrimonio familiar y decidir con calma qu\u00e9 hacer despu\u00e9s con los bienes recibidos.</p><p>Si tienes una <strong>herencia pendiente en Mallorca, Ibiza, Menorca o Formentera</strong> y necesitas capital para desbloquearla, podemos estudiar tu caso sin compromiso.</p><p>Solicita una valoraci\u00f3n y recibe una propuesta adaptada a tu situaci\u00f3n.</p>", "paragraph_spacing": {"unit": "px", "size": 36, "sizes": []}, "text_color": "#FFF6F6", "link_color": "#FFF6F6", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "0", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "_padding": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "0", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "__globals__": {"link_color": "", "link_hover_color": "globals/colors?id=secondary"}, "align": "left", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "d2aa567"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "c3ff6cc"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "text-editor", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "ced7ba6", "settings": {"title": "Resumen \u00fatil para valorar la operaci\u00f3n", "align": "center", "typography_typography": "custom", "title_color": "#FFFFFF", "_margin": {"unit": "px", "top": "20", "right": "0", "bottom": "020", "left": "0", "isLinked": false}, "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_repeater": [{"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#7C62FF", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 50, "sizes": []}, "_id": "73c5313"}, {"eael_vto_writing_gradient_color": "#FF6464", "eael_vto_writing_gradient_color_location": {"unit": "%", "size": 90, "sizes": []}, "_id": "578dd3f"}]}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "heading", "elType": "widget"}, {"id": "31903f2", "settings": {"html": "<div class=\"mi-tabla-ajustada\">\n    <table>\n        <thead>\n            <tr>\n                <th>Situaci\u00f3n habitual</th>\n                <th>C\u00f3mo ayuda la financiaci\u00f3n privada</th>\n            </tr>\n        </thead>\n        <tbody>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Pago de impuestos y notar\u00eda</strong></td>\n                <td>Obtener capital para formalizar la adjudicaci\u00f3n sin esperar al banco.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Herencia con cargas</strong></td>\n                <td>Cancelar deudas, cargas o importes pendientes con liquidez r\u00e1pida.</td>\n            </tr>\n            <tr>\n                <td><strong>Conservar el patrimonio familiar</strong></td>\n                <td>Evitar una venta precipitada y ganar margen de decisi\u00f3n.</td>\n            </tr>\n        </tbody>\n    </table>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n.mi-tabla-ajustada { margin: 20px 0; font-family: 'Suisse Intl', sans-serif; border: 1px solid #59819933; border-radius: 10px; overflow-x: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; box-shadow: none !important; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada table { width: 100%; min-width: 500px; border-collapse: collapse; background-color: #FFFFFF; margin: 0; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada thead th { background-color: #fcfcfc; color: #598199; padding: 12px 15px; text-align: center; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada td { padding: 12px 15px; color: #598199; font-size: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; text-align: center; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada td:first-child { text-align: left; font-weight: 500; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada tr td:last-child { background-color: #f8fbff; font-weight: 600; }\n.mi-tabla-ajustada tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }\n@media (max-width: 600px) { .mi-tabla-ajustada thead th { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px; } .mi-tabla-ajustada td { font-size: 11px; padding: 10px; } }\n</style>"}, "elements": [], "isInner": false, "widgetType": "html", "elType": "widget"}], "isInner": true, "elType": "container"}], "isInner": false, "elType": "container"}], "page_settings": {"eael_ext_toc_title": "Tabla de contenidos", "background_background": "classic", "background_image": {"url": "https://proactivofinance.com/wp-content/uploads/Vector-1-scaled.png", "id": 4499, "size": "", "alt": "", "source": "library"}, "background_repeat": "repeat", "background_size": "cover"}, "version": "0.4", "title": "landing plantilla",